# VAL.12 base-image exceptions (node:22-alpine bundled npm CLI).
# The packages below live ONLY under /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm (verified
# by image inspection; absent from pnpm-lock.yaml and from /monorepo app trees)
# and are not fixable from the app: npm is bundled with the node 22 line and
# the fixed npm ships with node >= 24 base images. Revisit when the base image
# is updated. Expiry for all entries below: 2026-12-31.

# pacote 19.0.2 bundled in npm CLI (fixed in npm bundled with node >= 24). Expiry: 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-9496
